{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16224410","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16224410","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1622441001:1":{"text":"啾咕咕……北风！是北风！北风呼啸之时，张开你的翅膀！","source_cn":"啾咕咕……北风！是北风！北风呼啸之时，张开你的翅膀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA77786F9ECED0414","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1622441002:1":{"text":"这风……温暖而有力，一定是先祖回应了我们的勇气！感谢您，林息者大人！","source_cn":"这风……温暖而有力，一定是先祖回应了我们的勇气！感谢您...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB877FDB8662BEC7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1622441003:1":{"text":"给予你们希望的不是先祖或我，而是你们自己在绝境中唤醒的勇气，和与生俱来的翅膀。","source_cn":"给予你们希望的不是先祖或我，而是你们自己在绝境中唤醒的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36B9CDD11B5EE1C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1622441004:1":{"text":"这股北风，本就孕育于这片森林的呼吸，我只是提前将它唤醒。","source_cn":"这股北风，本就孕育于这片森林的呼吸，我只是提前将它唤醒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6027B2FE7733A743","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1622441005:1":{"text":"飞吧，去南方建立你们的冬季家园。","source_cn":"飞吧，去南方建立你们的冬季家园。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C126CA1A66D764E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1622441005":{"text":"飞吧，去南方建立你们的冬季家园。","source_cn":"飞吧，去南方建立你们的冬季家园。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C126CA1A66D764E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1622441006:0":{"text":"嗯！三位，希望来年春风时，我们能再次相遇！","source_cn":"嗯！三位，希望来年春风时，我们能再次相遇！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA261559D8FCF88AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:12:1622441007:0":{"text":"在强劲的北风助力下，候鸟群振翅而起，坚定地飞向南方天际。","source_cn":"在强劲的北风助力下，候鸟群振翅而起，坚定地飞向南方天际。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x686B2BAF8C570812","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:0:1":{"text":"振翅高飞吧！","source_cn":"振翅高飞吧！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7A6AE35CB63E1DA9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"振翅高飞吧！","female":"振翅高飞吧！","variant_male_record_index":"86679","variant_female_record_index":"86680","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:1:2":{"text":"未来再会！","source_cn":"未来再会！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAE763F8D7ECEB6A8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"未来再会！","female":"未来再会！","variant_male_record_index":"86681","variant_female_record_index":"86682","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},